Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.77,English,en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}Take a hypothetical example: 199 eligible
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.17,Chinese,zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}用一组假设数字看差别：一百九十九名合
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.77,0:00:07.71,English,en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}soldiers at a 5% supply rate give an integer
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.17,0:00:08.24,Chinese,zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}格兵员，供给比例百分之五，整数预算是
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.71,0:00:08.79,English,en-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}budget of 9.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.24,0:00:12.32,Chinese,zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}九；围城比例百分之一，整数预算是一。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.79,0:00:10.90,English,en-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}A 1% siege rate gives 1.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.90,0:00:14.14,English,en-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}Calculated separately, they total 10.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.32,0:00:15.59,Chinese,zh-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}两项分别计算，合计是十。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.14,0:00:18.53,English,en-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}Combine the rates into 6% first, and 199 gives 11.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.59,0:00:18.29,Chinese,zh-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}要是先合成百分之六，再乘
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.29,0:00:21.21,Chinese,zh-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}一百九十九，就会算成十一。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.53,0:00:21.34,English,en-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}This illustrates rounding order.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.21,0:00:25.08,Chinese,zh-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}这张卡解释的是取整顺序，随后分到各
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.34,0:00:24.94,English,en-7,0,0,0,,{\q2}Allocation to individual regiments still
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.94,0:00:28.26,English,en-8,0,0,0,,{\q2}depends on their troop counts at that
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.08,0:00:28.72,Chinese,zh-7,0,0,0,,{\q2}兵团，还要继续按当时的人数处理。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.26,0:00:28.80,English,en-9,0,0,0,,{\q2}stage.
